<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <!-- Head -->
  <%- include('../partials/head.ejs') %>
  <body>
    <!-- Header -->
    <%- include('../partials/header.ejs') %>

    <!-- Main content-->
    <main class="main">
      <div class="club club--wide">
        <h2>Elevate Your Presence - Join The Inner Circle</h2>
        <section>
          <h3>Why Join?</h3>
          <p>Joining the Circle isn't just about a new badge—it's about accessing a higher standard of digital conversation. We've built a dedicated space for those who value depth, privacy, and meaningful connections.</p>
        </section>

        <hr>

        <section>
          <h3>The Member Benefits</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Encrypted Identity:  </strong><span>Your contributions are protected by industry-standard encryption, ensuring your ideas remain yours.</span></li>
            <li><strong>Zero-Surveillance Environment:</strong><span>No tracking, no data-mining, and no invasive algorithms. We provide the platform; you provide the voice.</span></li>
            <li><strong>Priority Discussions: </strong><span>Gain access to specialized boards where the community’s most insightful ideas are shared and developed.</span></li>
            <li><strong>Ad-Free Experience: </strong><span>A clean, distraction-free interface designed to keep the focus entirely on the conversation
              , not the noise.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <hr>

        <section class="membership">
          <h3>Apply for Membership</h3>
          <p class="membership__text">By joining the club, you aren't just a user — you're a stakeholder in a more intentional way to communicate.</p>
          
          <!-- Show errors -->
          <% if(locals.errors) { %>
            <%- include('../partials/errors.ejs') %>
          <% }  %>
          
          <form class="form" action="/club" method="POST">
            <div class="form__control">
              <label class="form__label" for="passphrase">Enter secret passphrase</label>
              <input
                class="form__input"
                id="passphrase"
                name="passphrase"
                placeholder="Secret passphrase..."
                type="password"
                required
                autofocus
                 />
            </div>
            <div class="form__control">
              <input
                id="show"
                type="checkbox"
                onclick="showPassphrase()"
                 />
              <label for="show">Show passphrase</label>
            </div>
            <button class="btn btn--cta" type="submit">Submit</button>
          </form>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <%- include('../partials/footer.ejs') %>

    <script>
      function showPassphrase() {
        const passphrase = document.querySelector('#passphrase')
        if(passphrase.type === 'password') {
          passphrase.type = 'text'
        } else {
          passphrase.type = 'password'
        }
      }
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
